```text
1. Understand requirements

2. Identify missing information

3. Research missing information

4. Analyze site/context

5. Identify building type

6. Define program

7. Estimate capacity

8. Establish adjacency graph

9. Establish zoning

10. Design circulation

11. Design vertical circulation

12. Establish structural strategy

13. Establish MEP/service strategy

14. Establish environmental strategy

15. Develop floor-plan alternatives

16. Translate to physical dimensions

17. Convert to grid/tile geometry

18. Validate

19. Detect failures

20. Compare alternatives

21. Iterate

22. Validate the entire building

23. Report assumptions and unresolved issues
```

Do not jump directly from requirements to coordinates.

